@host = http://localhost:5264

### Create a notification
POST {{host}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-101",
  "type": "Email",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Order Confirmed",
  "message": "Your order has been confirmed.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Invalid request (multiple validation errors)
POST {{host}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "type": "Sms",
  "recipient": "not-an-email",
  "message": "",
  "priority": "Urgent",
  "requestedDeliveryTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Get notifications for a customer
GET {{host}}/api/customers/CUST-101/notifications

### Get a notification by id (replace with a real id)
GET {{host}}/api/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Process due pending notifications
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/process
